      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/crook_city_south_dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Crook City Tribune launched on June 10, 1876, becoming the second newspaper in the Black Hills region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
